{
  "id": "zero-day-the-network",
  "title": "Zero Day",
  "sourceTitle": "Zero Day",
  "kind": "show",
  "synopsis": "A cyberattack takes the country down for one minute and kills three thousand people. You're a former president, asked back to chair the investigation. The answer, you suspect, is in your old administration's closets.",
  "releaseYear": 2025,
  "addedAt": "2026-04-06T00:00:00Z",
  "genre": "Thriller",
  "tags": [
    "politics",
    "cyber",
    "commission"
  ],
  "rating": 3,
  "loved": false,
  "nextStoryId": null,
  "startNodeId": "s1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "FBI Director, on a sofa in your study. The brief is one minute long. The minute was, as far as anyone can prove, foreign.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Briefing",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Take the commission",
          "consequence": "Lead.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Refuse and recommend someone",
          "consequence": "Decline.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "She does not want you to take it. She is, in the marital sense, correct. You take it anyway. She, in the marital sense, supports you.",
      "sceneTitle": "Your Wife",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Promise her a date",
          "consequence": "Marriage.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Promise her honesty",
          "consequence": "Marriage harder.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "You build a small staff — a former general counsel, a young technologist, a press secretary you respect.",
      "sceneTitle": "Staff",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Lead with the lawyer",
          "consequence": "Process.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        },
        {
          "text": "Lead with the technologist",
          "consequence": "Substance.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "The first hearing is, as expected, theater. You permit a small amount of it.",
      "sceneTitle": "First Hearing",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Use the theater",
          "consequence": "Strategic.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        },
        {
          "text": "Cut to substance",
          "consequence": "Discipline.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "text": "An NSA analyst comes to you quietly. He has data the agency has, he believes, redacted dishonestly. You verify him.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Whistle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Receive the data",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        },
        {
          "text": "Recommend formal whistleblower channels first",
          "consequence": "Process.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "You notice, between meetings, that you are forgetting things. Names. Dates. The press secretary does not, you can tell, want to be the one who tells you.",
      "sceneTitle": "Memory Issues",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "See a doctor immediately",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hide it for now",
          "consequence": "Strategic.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "text": "Your daughter, a congresswoman, has been briefed by her own staff that you are missing things. She comes to you. The conversation is difficult and loving.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Daughter",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Tell her everything",
          "consequence": "Family.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell her you'll handle it",
          "consequence": "Pride.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "text": "The whistleblower's data points to a backdoor you signed off on during your presidency. You did not, at the time, understand it fully. You sign off on many things.",
      "sceneTitle": "Closet, Old Administration",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Take responsibility publicly",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        },
        {
          "text": "Address it quietly first",
          "consequence": "Discretion.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "text": "Your press secretary asks if you want a statement. He has, separately, written two drafts. One is a full apology. One is a careful one.",
      "sceneTitle": "Press Secretary",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Use the full apology",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Use the careful one",
          "consequence": "Strategic.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "The current FBI Director meets you off the record. He is loyal to the institution. He is, in this case, on your side.",
      "sceneTitle": "Director",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Coordinate with him",
          "consequence": "Allies.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stay separate",
          "consequence": "Independence.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "A trip to Tokyo, Seoul, and Taipei, with the question 'who did this.' The answer, in your gut, is not what the briefings say.",
      "sceneTitle": "Asia Trip",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Trust your gut",
          "consequence": "Independent.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Trust the briefings",
          "consequence": "Process.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "Your doctor confirms early cognitive issues. The press will, eventually, learn. You decide what shape the disclosure takes.",
      "sceneTitle": "Memory Test",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Disclose now",
          "consequence": "Cleaner.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Disclose at the end of the commission",
          "consequence": "Strategic.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "Your old chief of staff is, you discover, lobbying for the cybersecurity firm at the center of the closet you just opened. He is a friend.",
      "sceneTitle": "Your Old Chief of Staff",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Confront him",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Subpoena him",
          "consequence": "Process.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "Someone in the executive branch — quietly, formally — would prefer you didn't.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Quiet Threat",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Push back through formal channels",
          "consequence": "Process.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Push back publicly",
          "consequence": "Sunlight.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "She makes coffee in the morning and doesn't ask. You realize, gratefully, that being silent with someone is also a form of supporting them.",
      "sceneTitle": "Your Wife, Again",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Tell her everything",
          "consequence": "Marriage.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just thank her",
          "consequence": "Marriage.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "Final hearing. The room is, somehow, both packed and tired. You speak for fourteen minutes without notes. You realize, mid-sentence, that you are, almost, telling the truth.",
      "sceneTitle": "Hearing, Final Day",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Tell all of it",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell most of it",
          "consequence": "Strategic.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "The final report is honest. It also, at your insistence, names the backdoor you signed. The press, expecting cover-up, doesn't quite know what to do.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Report",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Take questions immediately",
          "consequence": "Press.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let the report speak",
          "consequence": "Discipline.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "You resign from a board you sit on. The resignation is, in a quiet way, the punishment that fits.",
      "sceneTitle": "Resignation",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Resign quietly",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Resign with a public statement",
          "consequence": "Public.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "Your daughter calls. She read the report. She tells you she is proud of you. You realize, in your seventies, that this matters more to you than any other call you have taken.",
      "sceneTitle": "Daughter, Calling",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Tell her what's been going on with the doctor",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Save it for dinner",
          "consequence": "Family in person.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "You decide to write a memoir. The memoir is, finally, the honest one. The publisher, surprising you, is grateful.",
      "sceneTitle": "Memoir",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Lead with the failure",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Lead with the lessons",
          "consequence": "Frame.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "The diagnosis progresses, slowly. You spend time at the lake with your wife. The country, mostly, recovers.",
      "sceneTitle": "Last Year",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Spend the last good year with family",
          "consequence": "Family.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_legacy"
        },
        {
          "text": "Spend it on one last public good",
          "consequence": "Service.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_family"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the third path",
          "consequence": "Some endings reveal themselves last.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_service"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_legacy",
      "text": "The report becomes the foundation for the cybersecurity reforms that follow. You are remembered for the honesty more than the presidency. You decide, late, that that is exactly right.",
      "sceneTitle": "Legacy of the Report",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Legacy of the Report"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_family",
      "text": "You spend your last good years at the lake with your wife and daughter and three grandchildren who think you are mostly fun. The country goes on. You let it. You let yourself go on too.",
      "sceneTitle": "Lake House",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Lake House"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_service",
      "text": "You spend your last year on a quiet, careful piece of policy work. You finish it. The next administration adopts it. You don't, in the end, see it implemented. But the country is, by a small measure, safer because of you.",
      "sceneTitle": "One Last Good",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "One Last Good"
    }
  ]
}
